WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A wooden Great Seal given in 1945 concealed a listening device.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
It had no internal battery. An external radio beam supplied energy.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Room sounds changed the returning signal.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Discovered in 1952, displayed publicly in 1960. The complete intelligence haul remains uncertain.
